    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i know people care, but it’s just so much effort to keep trying to connect when everything feels so empty. it feels like i'm just dragging this life around for no reason. like, if things were just... gone, there wouldn't be any more struggle. no more loneliness. it wouldn't be a big deal to anyone, just a quiet end to a quiet life. doesn't that sound more restful than this constant weight?",
